+class MarginMinMaxObserver(MinMaxObserver):
+    """MinMax with headroom, for activations whose deployment range exceeds what calibration saw.
+
+    The DFlash draft's damage was clipping, not rounding: replaying the exported QDQ graph with
+    rounding removed but clipping kept reproduced the whole loss (cosine 0.7866, 0 of 8 argmax),
+    while rounding with clipping removed did not (0.9911, 5 of 8). Only about 0.002% of elements
+    clip, but they are the extremes that decide attention. Widening the range by 2x recovers it
+    (6 of 8); 4x and beyond starts giving the rounding error back.
